# Reproduce an overworld room scroll from the deterministic gameplay state.
TURBO ON
WAIT 2
LOAD_STATE tests/voxel_camera_test.nss
WAIT 8
SCREENSHOT zelda_voxel_transition_before.png
WAIT 2
WRITE_RAM8 0084 DD
HOLD DOWN
WAIT_RAM8 0012 07
WAIT 8
SCREENSHOT zelda_voxel_transition.png
RELEASE DOWN
WAIT_RAM8 0012 05
WAIT 8
SCREENSHOT zelda_voxel_transition_settled.png
WAIT 2
EXIT 0
